|---|---:|---|---|
| half B, kept I | 23 | +1.09 [+0.72, +1.43] | +0.71 [+0.39, +1.03] |
| all contexts, kept I | 23 | +1.11 [+0.78, +1.41] | +0.69 [+0.39, +1.01] |
| half B, all I | 50 | +0.53 [+0.19, +0.85] | +0.96 [+0.69, +1.20] |

**Natural gate (half B, kept I verbs): passes.**

Per matrix verb / auxiliary (half B, kept I): forgot: L +1.31 [+0.97, +1.65], O +0.64 [+0.32, +0.95]; heard: L +0.65 [+0.25, +1.01], O +0.76 [+0.37, +1.19]; know: L +1.30 [+0.95, +1.64], O +0.52 [+0.16, +0.84]; remember: L +1.10 [+0.70, +1.47], O +0.91 [+0.53, +1.32]

